  "post_content": "<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt; margin-left: -0.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Durante todo este domingo, 29 de junio, se est&aacute; desarrollando en l&#39;Espai Cultural del Raval de Onda una jornada de intercambio de libros, organizada por la &#39;biblioteca de adultos&#39;, con actividades para mayores y p&uacute;blico infantil.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt; margin-left: -0.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/06/IMG_8148.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt; margin-left: -0.65pt;\">Con horario de&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">las 10 a las 14 horas y de las 18 a las 21 horas, la jornada se ha iniciado con actividades en torno al centenario del libro Platreo y yo, de Juan Ram&oacute;n Jim&eacute;nez, a cargo de monitoras de M&oacute;n d&#39;Animaci&oacute;.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt; margin-left: -0.65pt;\"></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8149.jpg\" alt=\"img_8149\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8150.jpg\" alt=\"img_8150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8151.jpg\" alt=\"img_8151\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8152.jpg\" alt=\"img_8152\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8194.jpg\" alt=\"img_8194\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8195.jpg\" alt=\"img_8195\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8196.jpg\" alt=\"img_8196\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8197.jpg\" alt=\"img_8197\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8198.jpg\" alt=\"img_8198\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8199.jpg\" alt=\"img_8199\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8200.jpg\" alt=\"img_8200\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8201.jpg\" alt=\"img_8201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8202.jpg\" alt=\"img_8202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaintercanvillibresbiblioravalonda290614/img_8203.jpg\" alt=\"img_8203\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /